{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0102_1000_p", "source_sha256": "01c83d865f388299d17b500e29fef96be84eb8104f8564e7aa6295b18fca1ab5", "ja": "（今日のライブ、盛り上がっていたな。\nみんな、そろそろ帰り支度は済んだだろうか）", "zh": "（今天的演唱会盛况空前呢。\n大家差不多收拾好东西，准备离开了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0102_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "3c57d20beeec09a18f20226888aa71ae5a9f2fe09dca1c77555072535c4a1646", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}！\nあの、今日のライブ、どうでしたか？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦你了！\n请问你觉得今天的演唱会如何呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0102_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f0be86c82049c9e8d12e218d956de412d226d09fb77e5a31f570dbed6836f21e", "ja": "お疲れさま、琴葉。うん、まつりと並んでの\nキメポーズ、タイミングがバッチリそろってたな！", "zh": "琴叶，也辛苦你了。嗯，你最后跟茉莉站在一起\n摆出姿势的时机配合得恰到好处呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0102_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "ddd6aeca80eb8efe90c93abd841d06c9e104692ed0ae10f1c81fd684b54b18d9", "ja": "本当ですか！　よかった……。あそこは入りが\n難しくて、最初はなかなか合わなかったんです。", "zh": "真的吗！太好了……那边很难抓好时机切入，\n我们一开始都配合不好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0102_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "a4fdf6f339b263e72a9b9812990751cda2a4b3f57341cd9c0bdac565fafe4721", "ja": "でもまつりちゃんが練習につきあってくれて、\n上手くできるようになりました。", "zh": "多亏茉莉一直陪我练习，\n我才能顺利抓到切入时机。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0102_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0b35f9e34c32b5f7e1750d1ecbfe5594af4a14a047a3fca7e598024cc406dacd", "ja": "そうか。練習の成果がよく出てたよ。\n表情も明るくて、すごくかわいかった。", "zh": "这样啊，你充分展现出练习成果了喔。\n你当时的表情也很开朗，非常可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0102_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "8289c5e25b72fbe8923e4b26cdd402b6bb6ebb642162f413cee2b1d8800c1307", "ja": "え！？　か、かわいかったって、そんな……！\nあの、お世辞でも、うれしいです……。", "zh": "咦！？说、说什么可爱，太过奖了……！\n那个，就算是客套话，我也很高兴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0102_1007_p", "source_sha256": "61457be1d56e7e8045d51dc332167457e217a532731d6e7ceb6cf848c5db4de9", "ja": "お世辞じゃなくて、本心だよ。\n琴葉もまつりも、お姫様みたいだった！", "zh": "这不是客套话，是我的真心话。\n琴叶跟茉莉都表现得很像公主！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0102_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "62e4c7cd4acba414d8bec141f827715443aa6bec8894283ff2286bb79a00d5d1", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます……。恥ずかしかったけど、\nがんばってよかったかも……ふふっ。", "zh": "谢、谢谢你的夸奖……虽然很难为情，\n但这段时间的努力没有白费了……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
